testStats←{ ⍝ oracle stats policy: no pairs; one pair; zero variance; bootstrap; Elo only from finite endpoints
    z←⍬≡1 Boot ⍬
    one←0.5 0 1 0≡1 Boot,0.5
    f←1 Boot 10⍴1 ⋄ flat←(1 1 0≡f[0 2 3])∧1>1⊃f
    b←1 Boot 20⍴1 0.5 0 1 ⋄ boot←(1=3⊃b)∧(</b[1 0 2])∧b≡1 Boot 20⍴1 0.5 0 1
    e←(~∨/'Elo'⍷1 Report 10 2⍴1)∧∨/'Elo'⍷1 Report 20 2⍴1 0 0.5 1
    z∧one∧flat∧boot∧e
}
